    "text": "By The Bedford Citizen ,\n12 hours ago June is Pride Month, followed by Disability Pride Month in July. At the intersection of gender, sexuality, and disability, 3 million to 5 million LGBTQ+ Americans live with one or more disabilities, including 40% of lesbian women and trans adults. People from the disability community and the LGBTQ+ community face... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
